  "statement": "You are given an undirected graph G = (V, E) containing N nodes and M edges. The nodes are numbered from 1 to N. A subset C of V is a *vertex cover* if for every edge (u, v) \\in E, at least one of u and v belong to C. Note that C = V is always a vertex cover.",
